(6787063, 1019566, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bad halos around the flowers. I don''t know how you are or are not doing your processing, but the way I selectively process like this is to duplicate the layer, adjust one layer and then mask using a soft edged brush. That helps minimize obvious halos and sharp edges for me.</td>', 'Bad halos around the flowers. I don''t know how you are or are not doing your processing, but the way I selectively process like this is to duplicate the layer, adjust one layer and then mask using a soft edged brush. That helps minimize obvious halos and sharp edges for me.', '2012-06-06 01:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
