(6788138, 1019323, 35602, '<td valign="top">This is a very soft abstract, which is very different.  It has a lot of issues with lots of noise, which took away from the soft dreamy affect you were going for.  Maybe some noise reduction would be in order.  Lots of freeware for noise reduction is available if you do a search.</td>', 'This is a very soft abstract, which is very different.  It has a lot of issues with lots of noise, which took away from the soft dreamy affect you were going for.  Maybe some noise reduction would be in order.  Lots of freeware for noise reduction is available if you do a search.', '2012-06-06 19:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
