(6790470, 1019790, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, it''s peeking out from the darkness to surprise the viewer.<br/>Clever and thoughtful idea.  (I may swipe this one, one of these days.)</td>', 'Oh, it''s peeking out from the darkness to surprise the viewer.Clever and thoughtful idea.  (I may swipe this one, one of these days.)', '2012-06-08 11:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
