(6790984, 1019787, 28710, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, among all the flower pics, this one seems to have a real personality with the colors and individuality. 25% of the way through and this is my favorite so far.</td>', 'It''s funny, among all the flower pics, this one seems to have a real personality with the colors and individuality. 25% of the way through and this is my favorite so far.', '2012-06-09 11:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
