(6790989, 1019323, 28710, '<td valign="top">If this didn''t have such strong digital artifacting, I probably would have voted this an 8. I like the suggested lines of a flower, but it didn''t quite work.</td>', 'If this didn''t have such strong digital artifacting, I probably would have voted this an 8. I like the suggested lines of a flower, but it didn''t quite work.', '2012-06-09 11:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
