(6793976, 1019269, 12611, '<td valign="top">I knew this was special. Not only are you one of the best- but you are also clutch, coming up big in the challenges that matter. Hitting for average, and for power! Congrats!</td>', 'I knew this was special. Not only are you one of the best- but you are also clutch, coming up big in the challenges that matter. Hitting for average, and for power! Congrats!', '2012-06-13 09:46:22.000000', NULL, 0),
