(6793987, 1019249, 77188, '<td valign="top">I''m totally flabbergasted that this one didn''t end up getting a ribbon.  Oh well, at least you get my personal blue ribbon for this.</td>', 'I''m totally flabbergasted that this one didn''t end up getting a ribbon.  Oh well, at least you get my personal blue ribbon for this.', '2012-06-13 10:04:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6793994, 1019298, 28710, '<td valign="top">Came back for a look at this one. One of my favorites in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Great job. I was hoping for just a hair more detail in the flower itself and I am guessing you were too since there''s a halo artifact around the blue head. Looks like either a sharpening thing or possibly a mask of some sort. So you pretty much nailed the shot except for the flower head.<br/> <br/>Looks brilliant from 6 inches farther away though, which is a testament to your compo.</td>', 'Came back for a look at this one. One of my favorites in this challenge. Great job. I was hoping for just a hair more detail in the flower itself and I am guessing you were too since there''s a halo artifact around the blue head. Looks like either a sharpening thing or possibly a mask of some sort. So you pretty much nailed the shot except for the flower head. Looks brilliant from 6 inches farther away though, which is a testament to your compo.', '2012-06-13 10:07:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6794001, 1019531, 28710, '<td valign="top">Masterfully lit and I really like the subdued yellow tones in the flowers that you chose instead of the high-torque approach. Works very well for this shot.</td>', 'Masterfully lit and I really like the subdued yellow tones in the flowers that you chose instead of the high-torque approach. Works very well for this shot.', '2012-06-13 10:12:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6794009, 1019215, 28710, '<td valign="top">The soft glow and muted tones really work for this picture. I was a little put off by the dead heads....<br/> <br/>Not so sure that I would give flowers to anyone where 40% of them were dead. Except for the guy who almost knocked me and my passenger down, then stole my brand new HTC One 4 hours ago... heheh...<br/> <br/>As a picture on its own merits though, it''s pretty durned nice.</td>', 'The soft glow and muted tones really work for this picture. I was a little put off by the dead heads.... Not so sure that I would give flowers to anyone where 40% of them were dead. Except for the guy who almost knocked me and my passenger down, then stole my brand new HTC One 4 hours ago... heheh... As a picture on its own merits though, it''s pretty durned nice.', '2012-06-13 10:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6794016, 1019787, 28710, '<td valign="top">After the voting was done, I came back to revisit this one. <br/> <br/>My absolute favorite from the challenge. The flowers are practically jumping off the screen. Interesting that you managed to get such a feeling of dimension in what is essentially a totally flat scene. And the colors.... Don''t get me stahhhted on the colors! :)<br/> <br/>Had a rough day today and this one cheered me up. This will indeed be fantastic on someone''s wall.<br/> <br/>Not everyone''s pics started high... mine started in the low 5''s and moved up to nearly a 5.7. Go figure.</td>', 'After the voting was done, I came back to revisit this one.  My absolute favorite from the challenge. The flowers are practically jumping off the screen. Interesting that you managed to get such a feeling of dimension in what is essentially a totally flat scene. And the colors.... Don''t get me stahhhted on the colors! :) Had a rough day today and this one cheered me up. This will indeed be fantastic on someone''s wall. Not everyone''s pics started high... mine started in the low 5''s and moved up to nearly a 5.7. Go figure.', '2012-06-13 10:24:05.000000', NULL, 0),
